      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Будете вы.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'...You will.' He points at the staff.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Победитель получит премию.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'...The winner gets a bonus.' He promises a reward for the winner.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "И я не буду называть его инвалидом.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'...And I won't call him disabled.' Viktor offers a second prize.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
