      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Премия в конце месяца.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'...The bonus is at the end of the month.' Viktor clarifies the timeline.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "viktor",
      "t": "Но инвалидом перестану называть сразу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'...But I'll stop calling you disabled right away.' He will stop the insults immediately.",
      "gap": 0.4
